"{{Term/Store|My Hero||Series, BotW}}" is a [[Side Quest]] in {{BotW}}.<ref>{{Cite|{{Big|My Hero}}<br/>{{Color BotW|Side Quest|Outskirt Stable}}|Adventure Log|BotW}}</ref>

==Overview==
At [[Outskirt Stable]], [[Link]] can find [[Aliza]] standing under one of the [[Tree]]s across the road. When he speaks to her, Aliza reveals that she has been waiting for him.<ref>{{Cite|You're finally here...|Aliza|BotW}}</ref> She claims that the Tree she is standing at is sacred, and she has finally met the hero of Hyrule underneath it.<ref>{{Cite|So it was true! I met the hero of Hyrule under this sacred tree!|Aliza|BotW}}</ref> However, if Link has not yet acquired the [[Master Sword]], Aliza will retract her claim, regardless if Link affirms or denies the accusation.<ref>{{Cite|[Uh... What?] So you're not the hero of legend? I was so sure... ...But now that you mention it, you're way too scrawny to be the hero. And you don't have the {{Color BotW|Red|legendary sword}}.|Aliza|BotW}}</ref><ref>{{Cite|[Yes, I am the hero.] I knew it! At long last I— ...Wait a minute! You can't fool me! Everyone knows the hero of Hyrule wields the {{Color BotW|Red|legendary sword}}! You don't have it!|Aliza|BotW}}</ref>{{Note|If Link has already acquired the Master Sword before speaking to Aliza, she will discover that he is the hero regardless of how he responds to her.<ref>{{Cite|[Uh... What?] Don't try to hide it! That sword there is proof enough… you are the hero I've been waiting for! This...is a little something I've been saving for you. Please take it! |Aliza|BotW}}</ref><ref>{{Cite|[Yes, I am the hero.] I knew it was you! That sword leaves no room for doubt. I'm so happy to finally meet you! This...is a little something I've been saving for you. Please take it! |Aliza|BotW}}</ref><ref>{{Cite|[Bye.] Wait! I knew it was you! That sword leaves no room for doubt. I'm so happy to finally meet you! This...is a little something I've been saving for you. Please take it!|Aliza|BotW}}</ref>}} Aliza then asks Link to direct the hero to her should he encounter him,<ref>{{Cite|If you happen to meet the hero who wields the {{Color BotW|Red|legendary sword}} during your travels... Tell him I'm waiting for him here.|Aliza|BotW}}</ref> initiating the [[Side Quest]].

Upon retrieving the Master Sword, Link can return to Aliza underneath her sacred Tree and present it as proof of his status.<ref>{{Cite|So did you meet the hero of Hyrule?|Aliza|BotW}}</ref><ref>{{Cite|[I am he.] WHAT?! So...it WAS you!|Aliza|BotW}}</ref> Recognizing the Master Sword,<ref>{{Cite|That sword is proof enough... I'M SO HAPPY RIGHT NOW!|Aliza|BotW}}</ref> Aliza will accept Link as the hero she has waited for and present him with a [[Star Fragment]].<ref>{{Cite|This... is a little something I've been saving for you. Please take it!|Aliza|BotW}}</ref>{{Note|If Link's [[Inventory]] is full and he is unable to receive the Star Fragment, Aliza will ask Link to return to her when he has room.<ref>{{Cite|I want to give you something, but your pouch is totally full...as I would expect of a hero! Please come see me again once you have a little room in there. I'll be waiting!|Aliza|BotW}}</ref>}} Afterwards, Aliza will comment on how great it was to meet the hero, but since Link is not her type, she begrudges the fact that her excitement has dissipated.<ref>{{Cite|Oh, man. It feels SO good to check that off the bucket list! But...now that I've met you, some of the excitement's gone. I mean, you're not even my type...|Aliza|BotW}}</ref> She then leaves her spot from the base of the Tree, completing the Side Quest.<ref>{{Cite|Sorry, buddy. Well, toodle-oo!|Aliza|BotW}}</ref>

